OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns months-long sewer work
OL,4,Awill 'gridlock' Nairn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA planned #3.4m sewer upgrade risks
OL,7,Fcausing gridlock in Nairn while
OL,8,Fbringing "marginal" environmental
OL,9,Fbenefits, community groups have said.
OL,11,FScottish Water said its work on a storm
OL,12,Foverflow chamber and sewer pipeline in
OL,13,Fthe town's Lochloy Road area would
OL,14,Fbring "important improvements" and
OL,15,Favoid having to set up roadworks on the
OL,16,Fnearby A96.
OL,18,FThe utility company said the work along
OL,19,FLochloy Road could take two months and
OL,20,Fconstruction in a nearby car park about
OL,21,Feight months.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
