OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns months-long sewer work
OL,4,Awill 'gridlock' Nairn
OL,5,
OL,6,FNairn Improvement Community Enterprise
OL,7,F(Nice) and Nairn River Community
OL,8,FCouncil said disruption to the A96 was
OL,9,Funlikely to be avoided and suggested
OL,10,Fthere were alternative sites for the
OL,11,Fwork.
